{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1559347200, "end_date": 1560038399, "month_true_total": 1770, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:19:45 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "51126451", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011145173", "personaname": "[ShadowHowl]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RavioliShadow/", "num_games_owned": 429, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 6690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1993, "last_played": 1692507130, "avatar": "02c55890c5a4e14ea52d127c8f8b0377a4b7709d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Now that the game left EA, I only have 1 thing to say:.....ROCK AND STONES BROTHERS", "timestamp_created": 1560031618, "timestamp_updated": 1637791979, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51123557", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872767436", "personaname": "kwantum", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198872767436/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 77, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 64, "last_played": 1776024272, "avatar": "82c79aa488da18c10e83f8bf1f2de598b8276680"}, "language": "english", "review": "i really like how the enitrety of any map is destructable. The enemies are easy to kill but they still feel rewarding when you do kill them. The only thing i dont like is how small the player base is.", "timestamp_created": 1560019146, "timestamp_updated": 1560019146, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51123542", "author": {"steamid": "76561198183710662", "personaname": "Swooshbear.", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/crash8602/", "num_games_owned": 116, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 126, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 126, "last_played": 1521334792, "avatar": "0ad9d7517b17fb28ac8a567746f6d73a6f1216a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is super repetitive with no end goal or real motivation, Its just \"hey go out and mine ores for about a hour and shoot off endless monsters.\" and after you've done one mission there's no reward and then its onto the next mission but wait its almost the same exact thing but change which ores you mine during the mission. only thing going for this game is the cool classes and the style. 2 out of 5 stars.", "timestamp_created": 1560019080, "timestamp_updated": 1560019080, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.394611984491348267", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51118936", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974503313", "personaname": "aluyen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/aluyen/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 9027, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4109, "last_played": 1762663423, "avatar": "fdd8ea92b8f02d93d584de8178e18a108bcc3f4d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Imagine for a moment, if Warhammer, Left4Dead, Aliens and Minecraft could donate their DNA to create the perfect love child. Now get that love child blind drunk on fine dwarven ale, give it a pickaxe and a gun, then and fire it at high speed deep into a mineral-ridden planet full of arachnid monsters. Congratulations, you are now imagining Deep Rock Galactic.\n\nIf you love dwarves, *get this game now*.\n\nIf you don't love dwarves, get this game, play it once with 3 other good friends, and then you will realize the error of your ways and love dwarves.\n\nThis game distills everything that makes dwarves great (mining, shouting, laughing at danger, drinking beer and cheerfully killing monsters in huge amounts), wraps it up in a high-octane explosive bullet, and shoots it direct to your cerebral cortex.\n\nThis is Early Access done so, so right. It's a bargain at full price. Get it now. Do it for Karl.\n\nROCK AND STONE, BROTHERS!", "timestamp_created": 1560003498, "timestamp_updated": 1560003498, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "51115784", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042834690", "personaname": "GrizzliH ThaBot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042834690/", "num_games_owned": 275, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 13016, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 677, "last_played": 1766169425, "avatar": "c94baf741e5a254149f658789cdd5b2891d97bec"}, "language": "english", "review": "Extremely good 4 player co-op. I played it with 3 of my friends, it was epic!", "timestamp_created": 1559991626, "timestamp_updated": 1559991626, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}